{"id":"n24068-1-7","stage":2,"title":"의도 · 意图","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24068-1-7-1","ko":"거짓말까지 하면서 날 속였던 의도가 뭐야?","zh":"你甚至说谎来欺骗我，到底是什么目的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"거짓말까지","meaning":"谎言","explanation":"거짓말：谎言；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"거짓말","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28444","senseId":"1","lemma":"거짓말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거짓말까지","audio":"/audio/271014c47464d677e54c.mp3"}},{"text":"하면서","meaning":"说（说谎）","explanation":"거짓말을 하다：说谎；-면서：一边……一边……。这里承接具体说谎动作，不是泛指行为方式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면서","audio":"/audio/322ffdccdf0c979bc02e.mp3"}},{"text":"날","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}},{"text":"속였던","meaning":"骗，欺骗","explanation":"속이다：骗，欺骗；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"속이다","audio":"/audio/dc94e1b99a1052b4c925.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15597","senseId":"1","lemma":"속이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속였던","audio":"/audio/49128ffba18a2e04b596.mp3"}},{"text":"의도가","meaning":"意图","explanation":"의도：意图；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의도","audio":"/audio/72efa4a39d46eebed1c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24068","senseId":"1","lemma":"의도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의도가","audio":"/audio/db0f56d2ff176dfcb488.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a142bcee838500ea","term":"거짓말","zh":"谎言","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3","entryId":"28444","definition":"把非事实的事情编造成事实一样说的话。","pronunciation":["거ː진말"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说（说谎）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说（说谎）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dc94e1b99a1052b4","term":"속이다","zh":"骗，欺骗","audio":"/audio/dc94e1b99a1052b4c925.mp3","entryId":"15597","definition":"哄骗别人，使其相信虚假的东西为事实。","pronunciation":["소기다"]},{"id":"72efa4a39d46eebe","term":"의도","zh":"意图","audio":"/audio/72efa4a39d46eebed1c3.mp3","entryId":"24068","definition":"想要做某事的想法或计划。","pronunciation":["의ː도"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/e63179ef3f36bdd2618c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24068-1-7-2","ko":"그건 네가 더 잘 알잖아.","zh":"那件事你应该更清楚才对啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그건","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그건","audio":"/audio/cf51c782be532a251c41.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"알잖아.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알잖아","audio":"/audio/71668ac4577188515da9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ca4be06fb1732358c69.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.355,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24068","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1817,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那件事你应该更清楚才对啊。","你甚至说谎来欺骗我，到底是什么目的？","天气这么冷，去室内体育馆打羽毛球怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你甚至说谎来欺骗我，到底是什么目的？","天气这么冷，去室内体育馆打羽毛球怎么样？","那件事你应该更清楚才对啊。"],"answer":2}]}
